diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 9c80030..93f694f 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -6,6 +6,10 @@
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- Cold audit views resolve current document titles through bounded existing GETs
+  and shared query keys. Permission/not-found failures hide cached titles;
+  partial label errors preserve events and retry only repeatable reads.
+
 - Browser fixtures ждут готовый PageFrame после direct open и повторной SSO,
   а не только первоначальный URL HTML. Проверки layout/геометрии не ослаблены.
 
diff --git a/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md b/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
index 2efc3e8..916ad98 100644
--- a/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
+++ b/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
@@ -14,6 +14,13 @@ Wiki не владеет задачами, фазами, pipeline execution ил
 
 Task/phase dossier catalogs use separate bounded summary reads: the repository selects `limit + 1` keys in `C` collation order, then computes title and counts only for that page. Detail endpoints retain their nested document/evidence payloads. Legacy unbounded list endpoints remain for existing clients until consumers migrate.
 
+Audit document labels resolve through existing document GETs and shared query keys,
+limited to 20 distinct objects on the current page. Labels show current titles,
+not a historical title snapshot. Cached titles are not displayed before a fresh
+read on mount or after permission/not-found failures; lookup failures preserve
+audit events and technical IDs, with retry only for repeatable errors. Public
+audit DTOs, document APIs and persistence schemas are unchanged.
+
 ## 2. Клиенты и API
 
 ```text
